[size=5][b]Evil Console[/b][/size]

[b]Description[/b]
A Dear Modding UI replacement for the Fallout 4 console.

[b]Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*]Fallout 4
[*]F4SE matching your game runtime
[*]Address Library for F4SE Plugins matching your game runtime
[*]Dear Modding UI
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]
Install the release ZIP with your mod manager. Its contents correspond to Fallout 4's Data directory.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[i]Replace this section with the game versions and mod interactions verified for your plugin.[/i]
